{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"card":1,"entry":2,"missions":38,"alongside":53,"kin":62,"engines":87,"usedOn":88,"sites":89,"crewed":90,"museums":91,"hero":92},"https://www.orrerylearn.com/images/cards/fleet/atlas-lv-3b.jpg",{"id":3,"name":4,"category":5,"agency":6,"country":7,"manufacturer":8,"first_flight":9,"status":10,"era":11,"epoch":12,"best_known_for":13,"credit":14,"links":15,"linked_missions":28,"specs":33,"tagline":13,"dispatch":36,"description":37},"atlas-lv-3b","Atlas LV-3B","launcher","NASA","USA","Convair","1962","RETIRED","1957-1969","space-race","将水星计划宇航员送入轨道","Skeleton entry for /fleet (PRD-012 v0.2 / Phase A scaffold). Builder + agency + first-flight per public sources. Specs and gallery TBD in later phases.",[16,20,24],{"l":17,"u":18,"t":19},"Atlas LV-3B — Wikipedia","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Atlas_LV-3B","intro",{"l":21,"u":22,"t":23},"Project Mercury launches — NASA","https://www.nasa.gov/project-mercury/","core",{"l":25,"u":26,"t":27},"Mercury-Atlas 6 — NASA NSSDCA","https://nssdc.gsfc.nasa.gov/nmc/spacecraft/display.action?id=1962-003A","deep",[29,30,31,32],"friendship-7","aurora-7","sigma-7","faith-7",{"height_m":34,"diameter_m":35},29.06,3.05,"如果说Redstone是谨慎的一步，那么Atlas就是一次飞跃。它是美国第一枚洲际导弹，靠着大胆到近乎骇人的轻量化达到轨道速度：箭体蒙皮薄得必须像气球一样保持充压，才不会在自重下瘪塌。为这样的火箭做载人认证——把一个人托付给一枚泄压就会坍塌的导弹——是一个艰难的抉择，也正是它把Mercury计划分成亚轨道与轨道两半的关键。该计划中美国的每一次轨道飞行，乘坐的都是这只薄钢气球，也因此，格伦、卡彭特、施艾拉和库勃得以绕地球飞行，而谢泼德和格里森只是触到了地球的边缘。","Atlas LV-3B是Convair的轨道运载火箭，在1962年2月至1963年5月之间的四次飞行（Mercury-Atlas 6至9）中，把Mercury航天员送入轨道。这种蒙皮很薄的助推火箭——轻得需要靠加压才能直立——证明了弹道导弹可以通过载人认证。Mercury计划结束后退役。",[39,43,46,49],{"id":29,"name":40,"first":41,"year":42},"Friendship 7 / MA-6","首位环绕地球飞行的美国人",1962,{"id":30,"name":44,"first":45,"year":42},"Aurora 7 / MA-7","重演格伦 3 圈飞行任务；着陆点偏离目标 400 km",{"id":31,"name":47,"first":48,"year":42},"Sigma 7 / MA-8","首次教科书式的 Mercury 飞行——6圈轨道；飞行时间是格伦 / 卡彭特的两倍",{"id":32,"name":50,"first":51,"year":52},"Faith 7 / MA-9","美国最后一次单人载人轨道飞行；22 圈 / 34 小时",1963,[54,58],{"id":55,"name":56,"tagline":57},"mercury-capsule","Mercury 太空舱","美国首次载人航天飞行（谢泼德）",{"id":59,"name":60,"tagline":61},"lc-14","14号发射台","卡纳维拉尔角Mercury-Atlas发射台——发射了全部4次Mercury轨道飞行（格伦 / 卡彭特 / 施艾拉 / 库勃，1962-1963年）",[63,67,71,75,79,83],{"id":64,"name":65,"tagline":66},"titan-ii-glv","Titan II GLV","Project Gemini的工作马队",{"id":68,"name":69,"tagline":70},"mercury-redstone","Mercury-Redstone","首个美国载人火箭 — 陆军Redstone中程弹道导弹的改进型。发射了Freedom 7（1961-05-05）和Liberty Bell 7（1961-07-21）",{"id":72,"name":73,"tagline":74},"saturn-ib","Saturn IB","搭载Apollo 7、Skylab宇航员和ASTP",{"id":76,"name":77,"tagline":78},"saturn-v","Saturn V","将人类送上了月球",{"id":80,"name":81,"tagline":82},"atlas-slv-3d","Atlas SLV-3D Centaur","1970年代NASA外行星探测主力——Pioneer 10/11、Helios 1/2、Mariner 9/10、Pioneer Venus",{"id":84,"name":85,"tagline":86},"space-shuttle-stack","Space Shuttle堆栈","轨道器+ET+SRB;135次飞行任务",[],[],[],[],[],"/orrery/images/fleet-galleries/atlas-lv-3b/03.webp"],"uses":{"params":["id"]}}]}
